@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
title STATE MODELS - CV / JD / MATCHING

state "Resume Parsing" as Resume {
  [*] --> PENDING
  PENDING --> PROCESSING : exclusive claim\nexpected_revision + not deleted
  PROCESSING --> PARSED : terminal CAS\nsame revision + not deleted
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : terminal CAS\nsame revision + not deleted
  FAILED --> PENDING : retry same input => same revision\nor reparse => revision++ before enqueue
  PARSED --> PENDING : explicit reparse/pipeline upgrade\nrevision++ before enqueue
}

state "Job Parsing" as JobParsing {
  [*] --> J_PENDING
  J_PENDING --> J_PROCESSING : exclusive claim\nexpected_revision + not deleted
  J_PROCESSING --> J_PARSED : terminal CAS\nsame revision + not deleted
  J_PROCESSING --> J_FAILED : terminal CAS\nsame revision + not deleted
  J_FAILED --> J_PENDING : retry same input => same revision\nor reparse => revision++ before enqueue
  J_PARSED --> J_PENDING : raw_content/model/preprocessing change\nrevision++ before enqueue
}

state "Job Business Status" as JobBusiness {
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> ACTIVE : ready
  ACTIVE --> DRAFT : unpublish/edit
  ACTIVE --> CLOSED : close
  CLOSED --> DRAFT : prepare/edit
  CLOSED --> ACTIVE : reopen [ready]
}

state "Match Lifecycle" as Matching {
  [*] --> M_PENDING
  M_PENDING --> M_PROCESSING : exclusive claim\ngeneration + revisions + linked not deleted
  M_PROCESSING --> M_COMPLETED : terminal CAS\nsame expected values + linked not deleted
  M_PROCESSING --> M_FAILED : terminal CAS\nsame expected values + linked not deleted
  M_FAILED --> M_PENDING : retry => generation++
  M_COMPLETED --> M_PENDING : invalidate => generation++
}

note bottom of Resume
`revision` is input/computation version.
Worker terminal commit does not increment it.
Soft-delete is orthogonal lifecycle state and blocks claim/terminal writes.
end note

note bottom of JobParsing
Recovery re-dispatch of PENDING keeps same revision.
Soft-delete blocks claim/terminal writes.
end note

note bottom of JobBusiness
same-state PATCH idempotent.
DRAFT -> CLOSED is invalid.
ACTIVE requires PARSED + verified + embedding/model/preprocessing
+ >=1 job_skill + is_deleted=false.
end note

note bottom of Matching
Worker checks generation + stored snapshots + linked current revisions
+ linked Resume/JD is_deleted=false.
Duplicate/stale/deleted task must not overwrite.
FAILED requires error_message; other states require error_message=NULL.
end note
@enduml
